{
  "name": "miniaudio",
  "version": "0.11.26",
  "about": "sound played and recorded: files decoded (WAV, FLAC, MP3), mixed, with effects and a place in space",
  "homepage": "https://miniaud.io",
  "license": "public domain or MIT-0",
  "libraries": {
    "windows": "miniaudio.dll",
    "macos": "libminiaudio.dylib",
    "linux": "libminiaudio.so"
  },
  "build": {
    "sources": [
      {
        "url": "https://github.com/mackron/miniaudio/archive/refs/tags/0.11.26.tar.gz",
        "sha256": "838ba55a21c9142adf7b76bdc4351e5cd8b7ae128f46b25ec25f94ae9969c600",
        "files": {
          "miniaudio-0.11.26/miniaudio.c": "src/miniaudio.c",
          "miniaudio-0.11.26/miniaudio.h": "include/miniaudio.h",
          "miniaudio-0.11.26/LICENSE": "LICENSE"
        }
      }
    ],
    "compile": [
      "src/miniaudio.c",
      "alloc.c"
    ],
    "include": [
      "include"
    ],
    "macos_link": [
      "-framework",
      "CoreFoundation",
      "-framework",
      "CoreAudio",
      "-framework",
      "AudioToolbox"
    ],
    "linux64_link": [
      "-ldl",
      "-lpthread",
      "-lm"
    ]
  },
  "bindings": {
    "alias": "Ma",
    "headers": [
      "include/miniaudio.h"
    ],
    "strip": "ma_",
    "strip_constants": [
      "MA_",
      "ma_"
    ],
    "skip_like": [
      "^miniaudio_h$",
      "^MA_API$",
      "^MA_PRIVATE$",
      "^MA_INLINE$",
      "^MA_HAS_",
      "^MA_SUPPORT_",
      "^MA_ENABLE_",
      "^MA_SIZEOF_PTR$",
      "^MA_(WIN32|APPLE|LINUX|UNIX|POSIX|DESKTOP|X64|X86|ARM|ARM64|64BIT|32BIT)",
      "^MA_VERSION_STRING$",
      "^MA_SIZE_MAX$",
      "^MA_ATOMIC",
      "^MA_CC",
      "^MA_NO_",
      "^MA_USE_"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "A function is Ma.name for C's ma_name (Ma.engine_init, Ma.engine_play_sound), and a constant",
      "Ma.NAME for MA_NAME or ma_name (Ma.SUCCESS, Ma.format_f32); a struct keeps C's whole name (ma_engine).",
      "Some of its structs differ from one system to the next (a ma_sound, a ma_decoder, a ma_device):",
      "those are held by their address, made with Ma.new_sound and the like, and freed with Ma.delete."
    ],
    "handles": true
  }
}
